============================================================================
  livebook.best()['age_ms'] = now - rx_ms of the last book MESSAGE (feed freshness).
  pindata's 'age_ms'        = ts - born[(side,price)] (how long the RESTING LEVEL has stood).
  A pindata row exists only on a second in which a delta arrived, so its FEED age is ~0 ms by construction: the live 2000 ms gate removes nothing the backtest had.  LEVEL age, measured anyway:
